  "locationAddress": "1st Floor, Sona Towers, Hosur Rd, next to Nexa Showroom, Chikku Lakshmaiah Layout, S.G. Palya, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560029",
  "jdDisplay": "<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>Who are we, and what do we do?</strong></p><p><br></p><p>ShareChat (Mohalla Tech Pvt Ltd) is India’s largest homegrown social media company and the only local player to achieve profitability in the industry, with 200+ million Monthly Monetizable Users across all its platforms.</p><p><br></p><p>Founded in 2015, ShareChat has social media brands such as the ShareChat App and Moj App and micro drama app QuickTV under its portfolio. QuickTV, the newest addition to ShareChat's family of apps, crossed the 10 million downloads mark within 3 months of launch and currently has 60Mn MAUs across the network viewing the vertical episodic content.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Today, the ShareChat network maintains a whopping 1,000 Cr ARR and is India’s leading social media platform servicing users across the country in 15 regional languages. This growth has led to a 28% YoY revenue growth in the July-Sept (2025-26) quarter and increased it by more than 60% in the Oct-Dec quarter.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">What You’ll Do?</strong></p><p><br></p><p>The Marketing Intern will support the Marketing team in the execution and optimisation of acquisition marketing campaigns. They will assist with day-to-day campaign operations across Android (India and international markets), web campaigns, and the upcoming iOS acquisition launch. Responsibilities include supporting campaign setup and monitoring, checking budget pacing, preparing daily and weekly reports, assisting with creative testing and tracking, conducting competitor and creative research, and coordinating with product, analytics, and creative teams under the guidance of the Marketing Associate.</p><p><br></p><p>■ Assist with setting up, monitoring, and maintaining acquisition marketing campaigns across relevant channels</p><p>■ Track campaign performance and budget pacing, escalating discrepancies or issues to the Marketing Associate</p><p>■ Help prepare and update daily and weekly campaign reports using available data</p><p>■ Support creative testing by organising assets, tracking results, and documenting learnings</p><p>■ Conduct basic competitor and creative research to inform campaign planning</p><p>■ Coordinate with product, analytics, and creative teams on campaign requirements and follow-ups</p><p>■ Campaign information, budgets, and tracking are maintained accurately and on time</p><p>■ Regular performance reports are complete, clear, and shared according to the team's schedule</p><p>■ Creative tests and research are documented to help the team identify useful campaign insights</p><p>■ Campaign issues and data discrepancies are promptly flagged to the Marketing Associate</p><p>■ Assigned tasks are completed reliably, with a willingness to learn and follow established processes</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Who Are you?</strong></p><p><br></p><p>■ Mandatory: Interest in and basic understanding of acquisition marketing</p><p>■ Strong analytical and quantitative aptitude</p><p>■ Working knowledge of Excel / Google Sheets; SQL is a plus</p><p>■ Basic understanding of performance marketing and ad platforms such as Meta and Google; prior internship or project exposure is helpful but not required</p><p>■ Attention to detail and comfort working with data</p><p>■ Eagerness to learn, a responsible approach to assigned tasks, and good communication skills</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Where you’ll be?</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Bangalore</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What's in it for you?</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">At ShareChat, our values—</strong><strong>Ownership, Speed, User Empathy, Integrity, and First Principles</strong>—are at the core of our ways of working. We believe in hiring top talent and grooming future leaders by providing a flexible environment to aid growth and development.</p>",
